fluid_design_preset_standard_desc = Neutral and clear: indigo, Inter, balanced steps – the kit's default.
fluid_design_preset_redaxo = REDAXO · Blue
fluid_design_preset_redaxo_desc = In the style of redaxo.org: blue header, blue headings in Exo, text in Source Sans, dark footer, round buttons – colors from the REDAXO backend.
fluid_design_preset_kanzlei = Law firm · Midnight blue & serif
fluid_design_preset_kanzlei_desc = Serious and calm: Newsreader headings, square shapes, centered header, flat steps.
fluid_design_preset_handwerk = Craft business · Terracotta
fluid_design_preset_handwerk_desc = Bold and approachable: Bricolage Grotesque, round buttons, floating header, dot grid.
fluid_design_preset_praxis = Medical practice · Sage
fluid_design_preset_praxis_desc = Calming and friendly: sage green, Instrument Sans, soft cards with shadow, gentle gradient.
fluid_design_preset_agentur = Agency · Contrast
fluid_design_preset_agentur_desc = Loud and confident: very large steps, Bricolage 800, violet and lime, grid background.
fluid_design_preset_verein = Club · Fresh
fluid_design_preset_verein_desc = Open and cheerful: blue and sunny yellow, bold DM Sans, shadowed cards, tags.
fluid_design_preset_restaurant = Restaurant · Bordeaux & cream
fluid_design_preset_restaurant_desc = Warm and indulgent: Fraunces with optical sizes, cream tones, outline buttons, centered header.
fluid_design_preset_startup = Tech startup · Night
fluid_design_preset_startup_desc = Dark from the start: Space Grotesk, monospace tags, glass cards, grid and glowing blue.
fluid_design_preset_kultur = Culture · Museum
fluid_design_preset_kultur_desc = Striking and reduced: Instrument Serif in very large steps, signal red, no rounding, sidebar.
fluid_design_preset_sozial = Social services · Two brand colors
fluid_design_preset_sozial_desc = Warm and reliable: orange and green as brand colors, Lato, highlighter emphasis, info bar, dark footer.
fluid_design_preset_verband = Association · Bordeaux & uppercase
fluid_design_preset_verband_desc = Strong and organized: Roboto Condensed in uppercase, header in brand color, info bar, slanted transitions.
fluid_design_preset_gesundheit = Health · Clear & accessible
fluid_design_preset_gesundheit_desc = Easy to read for everyone: Atkinson Hyperlegible, larger base font, calm steps, round images, clear links.
fluid_design_preset_betrieb = Business & emergency service · Matter-of-fact
fluid_design_preset_betrieb_desc = Clear and robust: Roboto with Roboto Slab, square shapes, dark header, info bar for emergency service and phone.
fluid_design_preset_kommune = Municipality & portal · Friendly
fluid_design_preset_kommune_desc = Inviting and colorful: Poppins, violet and petrol, round shapes, waves between sections, centered footer.
fluid_design_preset_wissen = Knowledge & campaign · Dark
fluid_design_preset_wissen_desc = Narrative and atmospheric: dark from the start, Manrope, glass cards, gentle gradient, gradient emphasis.
fluid_design_preset_netzwerk = Network & education · Colorful with sidebar
fluid_design_preset_netzwerk_desc = Lively and well organized: header banner with large logo, sidebar with menu tree below, five alternating colors, Nunito, round shapes – for networks, educational institutions and associations.
fluid_design_preset_aurora = Software & product · Aurora
fluid_design_preset_aurora_desc = Modern and light: Manrope, color veil in the background, gradient buttons, cards with gradient borders, colored sections as surfaces, reading progress.
fluid_design_preset_brutal = Studio · Neo-brutalism
fluid_design_preset_brutal_desc = Striking and playful: Space Grotesk, strong outlines with hard shadows, outline text for emphasis, grain, color band above the footer.
